{"seq":2,"slug":"keyboard-navigation-focus","title":"键盘导航与焦点管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/keyboard-navigation-focus","wordCount":1018,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"键盘导航与焦点管理\">键盘导航与焦点管理</h1><p>每个通过鼠标可完成的操作都必须能通过键盘完成——这是 WCAG 2.1.1 (Keyboard) Level A 的核心要求，也是所有辅助技术交互的基础。屏幕阅读器用户使用键盘操作，语音控制用户触发的是键盘事件，开关设备的扫描逻辑依赖焦点序列。键盘可访问性不是「额外功能」，而是整个无障碍交互栈的地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>焦点管理包含两个维度：<strong>焦点序列</strong>（哪些元素可聚焦、顺序如何）和<strong>焦点行为</strong>（聚焦时如何指示、操作时如何移动）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[键盘导航体系] --&gt; B[Tab 序列]&#10;    A --&gt; C[组件内导航]&#10;    A --&gt; D[焦点指示器]&#10;    A --&gt; E[焦点管理策略]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[自然 Tab 序列 = DOM 顺序]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[tabindex 调整]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[Skip Links]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[箭头键导航]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Roving Tabindex]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[aria-activedescendant]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[默认 outline]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[自定义焦点环]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[对比度要求 3:1]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[焦点陷阱 Focus Trap]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[焦点恢复]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[焦点重定向]\">graph TD\n    A[键盘导航体系] --&gt; B[Tab 序列]\n    A --&gt; C[组件内导航]\n    A --&gt; D[焦点指示器]\n    A --&gt; E[焦点管理策略]\n    B --&gt; B1[自然 Tab 序列 = DOM 顺序]\n    B --&gt; B2[tabindex 调整]\n    B --&gt; B3[Skip Links]\n    C --&gt; C1[箭头键导航]\n    C --&gt; C2[Roving Tabindex]\n    C --&gt; C3[aria-activedescendant]\n    D --&gt; D1[默认 outline]\n    D --&gt; D2[自定义焦点环]\n    D --&gt; D3[对比度要求 3:1]\n    E --&gt; E1[焦点陷阱 Focus Trap]\n    E --&gt; E2[焦点恢复]\n    E --&gt; E3[焦点重定向]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Tab 行为</th>\n<th>对应元素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自然可聚焦</td>\n<td><code>&lt;a href&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code></td>\n<td>DOM 顺序决定 Tab 顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tabindex=&quot;0&quot;</td>\n<td>任何元素</td>\n<td>加入自然 Tab 序列，位置由 DOM 顺序决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;</td>\n<td>任何元素</td>\n<td>可通过 <code>focus()</code> 程序化聚焦，但不在 Tab 序列中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tabindex=&quot;正数&quot;</td>\n<td>任何元素</td>\n<td>强烈不推荐——打乱自然顺序，维护噩梦</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"tab-序列与-dom-顺序的对齐\">Tab 序列与 DOM 顺序的对齐</h2><p>Tab 序列默认跟随 DOM 源码顺序（而非视觉渲染顺序）。CSS Flexbox 的 <code>order</code> 和 Grid 的放置会导致视觉顺序与 DOM 顺序不一致——视力正常的键盘用户会看到焦点「跳跃」到视觉上不相邻的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 危险模式：视觉顺序与 DOM 顺序不一致 */&#10;.nav {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;}&#10;.nav-item:last-child {&#10;  order: -1;&#10;} /* 视觉第一但 DOM 最后 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 危险模式：视觉顺序与 DOM 顺序不一致 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.nav-item:last-child</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 视觉第一但 DOM 最后 */</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>工程原则：</strong> 保持 DOM 顺序与视觉阅读顺序一致。如果必须用 CSS 重排，确保 Tab 顺序仍然符合用户的视觉预期——否则需要重构 DOM 结构而非依赖 <code>tabindex</code> 正数值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"skip-links-跳过链接\">Skip Links（跳过链接）</h2><p>对于包含复杂导航的页面，键盘用户每次访问都需要 Tab 过所有导航链接才能到达主内容。Skip Link 提供快捷跳转：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;body&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 通常视觉隐藏，获焦时显示 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;a href=&quot;#main-content&quot; class=&quot;skip-link&quot;&gt;跳到主要内容&lt;/a&gt;&#10;  &lt;nav&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- 30+ 个导航链接 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;/nav&gt;&#10;  &lt;main id=&quot;main-content&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; 确保可接收焦点但不在 Tab 序列 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;/main&gt;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 通常视觉隐藏，获焦时显示 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#main-content\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"skip-link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>跳到主要内容&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- 30+ 个导航链接 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main-content\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- tabindex=\"-1\" 确保可接收焦点但不在 Tab 序列 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".skip-link {&#10;  position: absolute;&#10;  top: -100%;&#10;  left: 0;&#10;  z-index: 1000;&#10;  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;&#10;  background: var(--color-primary);&#10;  color: var(--color-on-primary);&#10;}&#10;.skip-link:focus {&#10;  top: 0; /* 获焦时显示 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.skip-link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--color-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--color-on-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.skip-link:focus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 获焦时显示 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"组件内导航-roving-tabindex-模式\">组件内导航：Roving Tabindex 模式</h2><p>复合组件（工具栏、标签列表、单选组、菜单）的内部不应每个子项都占一个 Tab stop——用户需要 Tab 进入组件，然后用箭头键在子项间移动，再 Tab 离开：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 标签列表：只有活跃标签在 Tab 序列中 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div role=&quot;tablist&quot; aria-label=&quot;内容标签&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;button role=&quot;tab&quot; aria-selected=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; aria-controls=&quot;panel-1&quot;&gt;概览&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;button role=&quot;tab&quot; aria-selected=&quot;false&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; aria-controls=&quot;panel-2&quot;&gt;详情&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;button role=&quot;tab&quot; aria-selected=&quot;false&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; aria-controls=&quot;panel-3&quot;&gt;评论&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 标签列表：只有活跃标签在 Tab 序列中 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tablist\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"内容标签\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tab\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-selected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-controls</span><span style=\"color:#2