>// 恢复焦点到触发按钮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { once: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>焦点恢复的原则是「回到最后操作的上下文」——如果触发元素在关闭后已不存在（如删除操作后列表项消失），焦点应移动到最近的逻辑邻居。</p>\n<h2 id=\"焦点指示器设计\">焦点指示器设计</h2><p>WCAG 2.4.7 要求焦点可见，WCAG 2.4.13 (AAA) 进一步要求焦点指示器面积和对比度。工程实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 基础：保持浏览器默认 outline（不要 outline: none） */&#10;:focus-visible {&#10;  outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring-color);&#10;  outline-offset: 2px;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 高级：对比度自适应——在浅色和深色背景上都清晰 */&#10;:focus-visible {&#10;  outline: 3px solid transparent;&#10;  box-shadow:&#10;    0 0 0 2px var(--surface-color),&#10;    /* 内层：背景色隔离 */ 0 0 0 4px var(--focus-ring-color); /* 外层：焦点环 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 基础：保持浏览器默认 outline（不要 outline: none） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:focus-visible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  outline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> solid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--focus-ring-color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  outline-offset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 高级：对比度自适应——在浅色和深色背景上都清晰 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:focus-visible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  outline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> solid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> transparent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  box-shadow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--surface-color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 内层：背景色隔离 */</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--focus-ring-color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 外层：焦点环 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>:focus-visible</code> 优于 <code>:focus</code>——前者只在键盘导航时显示焦点环，鼠标点击时不显示，解决了「设计师讨厌 outline」与「键盘用户需要 outline」的矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Tab 序列跟随 DOM 顺序，避免用 CSS <code>order</code> 或 <code>tabindex</code> 正数打乱</li>\n<li>复合组件使用 Roving Tabindex：一个 Tab stop + 箭头键内部导航</li>\n<li>模态对话框必须焦点陷阱——2026 优先用原生 <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code> + <code>inert</code></li>\n<li>关闭浮层后恢复焦点到触发元素</li>\n<li>使用 <code>:focus-visible</code> 实现键盘可见但鼠标不扰的焦点环</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇：<a href=\"accessible-components-patterns\">WAI-ARIA APG 组件模式</a>——将键盘导航模式应用到具体交互组件</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../../frontend-design-tokens-systems/structure/theming-modes\">前端设计令牌 — 主题模式</a>——焦点环令牌如何在主题切换中保持一致</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"键盘导航与焦点管理","id":"键盘导航与焦点管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Tab 序列与 DOM 顺序的对齐","id":"tab-序列与-dom-顺序的对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"Skip Links（跳过链接）","id":"skip-links-跳过链接"},{"level":2,"text":"组件内导航：Roving Tabindex 模式","id":"组件内导航-roving-tabindex-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"焦点陷阱（Focus Trap）","id":"焦点陷阱-focus-trap"},{"level":2,"text":"焦点恢复策略","id":"焦点恢复策略"},{"level":2,"text":"焦点指示器设计","id":"焦点指示器设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"ARIA 角色、状态与属性实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/aria-roles-properties"},"next":{"title":"WAI-ARIA APG 组件模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/accessible-components-patterns"}}